<h2>Step 3 — Vaccinee signature &amp; consent</h2>
<label>Signature (drawn or typed)
  <textarea name="patient_signature" rows="3" required></textarea>
</label>
<label>
  <input type="checkbox" name="consented_to_data_sharing" value="yes" />
  I consent to onward sharing of this certificate data with destination
  health authorities.
</label>
